### Convert a source to Markdown
POST http://localhost:8082/markdown
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "embeddings": true
}

### Poll the job (paste the id from the POST response)
GET http://localhost:8082/markdown/PASTE_JOB_ID
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
